        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-T9, American Relic Series Southern Manor Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith true southern style, this towel bar brings a touch of the country life to your bathroom with a quiet elegance. The Southern Manor Towel Bar is available in 3 sizes: 18 inch, 24 inch, and 30 inch. Choose from antique relic pewter, medium relic bronze, or dark rustic bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/southern-manor-towel-ring-fusion-tr-t9\"><b>Southern Manor Towel Ring</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/southern-manor-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-t9\"><b>Southern Manor Toilet Tissue Holder</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/southern-manor-robe-hook-fusion-rh-t9\"><b>Souther Manor Robe Hook</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-T9</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-T9</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-T9</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
